        <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, padding: 14, background: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                下一步：用 Cello 网页版跑一次自己的布线，比对本次 assignment 是否稳定；有条件时先做单门表征，再拼整条线路。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 520, width: 1200, height: 92, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 24px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
